    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of your own thriving farm where every decision counts - Balance worker satisfaction with productivity, develop specialized staff, commit to the right contracts, control your farm\u2019s pest population, manage your water supply, and choose how your farm evolves as your reputation grows! Will you focus on biodiversity and building a skilled workforce, or streamline operations through chemicals and advanced technology? The future of your farm is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/061a123feb02235d4ab4cabe04f7d34a.webp?t=1751807852\" width=616 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6c65b9919a616e60357d57642b1edb12.poster.avif?t=1751807852\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6c65b9919a616e60357d57642b1edb12.webm?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6c65b9919a616e60357d57642b1edb12.mp4?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit your local TalentCo recruiting agency every day to see potential new hires with unique skillsets and salary expectations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign jobs to your farmhands: Let them handle basic tasks around the farm like watering, harvesting, building, mining, chopping, and caring for livestock!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure you have the cash to pay your farmhands\u2019 daily salaries, or their happiness will fall, and they may quit the farm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your team members with new tasks! This will develop their skillsets over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approve or decline their day-off and raise requests \u2013 Will you risk their happiness to save on productivity and salary costs?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind the happiness of your workforce can boost or damage your farm\u2019s reputation over time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/a05740c4ac0318ce9600c253028854c4.webp?t=1751807852\" width=617 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/a2f673456d1d51fc3d7c4dc64e6fc238.poster.avif?t=1751807852\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/a2f673456d1d51fc3d7c4dc64e6fc238.webm?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/a2f673456d1d51fc3d7c4dc64e6fc238.mp4?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like real farming, pests are a constant threat to your crops. Once they get a foothold, they can spread to neighboring crops, and eventual wipe out entire fields!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a diverse range of crop types to slow pests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract predatory insects (butterflies, bees, and dragonflies) by growing flowers, and building apiaries - Let them \u201cmanage\u201d the pests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build chicken coops and encourage your chickens to wander around your crops \u2013 Pests make for great chicken feed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray pesticide to eliminate pests \u2013 A costly option but is extremely effective</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/9ff5cbf351c10ad0640861ba01e9f38b.webp?t=1751807852\" width=616 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6909c18351ad0f82272d21c1a28f0677.poster.avif?t=1751807852\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6909c18351ad0f82272d21c1a28f0677.webm?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/6909c18351ad0f82272d21c1a28f0677.mp4?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water sources can run dry. Yes, even your starting pond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precious rain not only waters your crops for the day but replenishes your water stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build rain barrels and water towers to collect as much rain as possible on rainy days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the weather forecast to plan for upcoming rainfalls and inevitable droughts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run underground piping and connect your sprinklers to water stores. Be mindful though! Sprinklers can use a lot more water than a water jug</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/72486b59500f86af42776d39da7826c6.webp?t=1751807852\" width=616 height=42 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out by selling your farm\u2019s products to the local farmer\u2019s market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit to major contracts with traveling company reps - After all, the local farmer\u2019s market can only buy so much of your harvest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill contract requirements and meet deadlines to grow your farm\u2019s reputation. But don\u2019t overcommit! A missed contract can be very damaging to your farm\u2019s reputation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/e9e12e8ab04c4c4514118f4f15fdec1c.webp?t=1751807852\" width=617 height=43 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/52b67cbe8c36c4551621508912468081.poster.avif?t=1751807852\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/52b67cbe8c36c4551621508912468081.webm?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820590/extras/52b67cbe8c36c4551621508912468081.mp4?t=1751807852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to improve your workforce, unlock farm tech, expand your biodiversity, or upgrade your business acumen? Decide your farm\u2019s evolution at every reputation level-up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock staffing upgrades to grow and enhance your team of farmhands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock farm technology like sprinklers, water pumps, tillers and seed spreaders to expand your farm through technological advancement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade crops &amp; buildings to strengthen your farm\u2019s biodiversity and sustainability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock business enhancements like upgrading the local farmer\u2019s market or improving contract opportunities to increase sales!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
